From: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>

Signed-off-by: ynk <evils.ynk@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550-oneplus-salami.dts |  797 ++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/configs/salami_defconfig                |  996 ++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 1793 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550-oneplus-salami.dts
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/configs/salami_defconfig

